# Play test of The Sunken Archive (CIPlay sunken_archive, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the jetty
# (0.55 m) at the reading room's door on the archive's north face, the reading room (0.5 m), the flooded stacks below
# (floors at -2.55 and -5.6 m, broken windows), the air pocket in the deepest room.
# Quest "Card Catalogue", 10 steps: reading room, letter, shelf box, floor box, the deepest room's air pocket, the vault,
# the keeper, the deep box, the three cards, the vault opened.
island The Sunken Archive
expect step 0
expect title Card Catalogue

# Along the jetty into the reading room: the archivist's letter
walk -6 0 to -6.5 -6 to -6.5 -9.5 h=0.5
zone readingroom
expect step 1
read Archivist's letter
expect step 2

# The flooded stacks: two card boxes on the upper flooded floor, the third in the deepest room (its air pocket, the
# vault's keeper)
at -6 -14.5 h=-1.4
open Shelf card box
expect step 3
at -3.6 -9.5 h=-1.4
open Floor card box
expect step 4
at -4.5 -14.5 h=-4.4
air deepair
zone vault
expect step 6
kill Angler fish
expect step 7
open Deep card box
expect story card 3
expect step 9

# Up in the reading room: the cards through the index desk; down to the vault
use indexterminal
expect message whirrs
expect story card 0
open Rare book vault
wait 5
expect item Blueprint_EngineControls 1
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineBase 1
expect done
